Gauntlets of Power or 18/** strength are not enough to carry a boulder
upstairs.  There are several ways you could do it though.

1. Polymorph into a giant
2. Have a pet giant do it for you (I haven't tried this)
3. bag of holding abuse (I haven't tried this either)
4. If you get a boulder into a blessed bag of holding, you
   can carry it upstairs.  To get it into the bag of holding,
   you first have to pick it up, and to do that you'd have to
   either polymorph into a giant, use bag of holding abuse (?),
   or wish for a boulder (probably not the most useful wish).

